p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24">We=E2=80=99re excit=
ed to introduce Agent 3=E2=80=94our most advanced and autonomous Agent yet.=
 Compared to Agent V2, it is a major leap forward. It is<strong> 10x more a=
utonomous</strong>, with the ability to periodically test your app in the b=
rowser and automatically fix issues using our proprietary testing system=E2=
=80=94<strong>3x faster and 10x more cost-effective than Computer Use model=
s</strong>. Even better, Agent 3 can <strong>now generate other agents and =
automations</strong> to streamline your workflows.</p><p class=3D"hover:pro=
se-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24"> </p><h3 id=3D"what's-new" class=3D"tex=
t-2xl font-semibold leading-tight mt-40 mb-20"><strong>What=E2=80=99s New</=
strong></h3><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24"></p><h=
3 id=3D"1.-app-testing:-agent-tests-the-apps-it-builds-(using-an-actual-bro=
wser)" class=3D"text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight mt-40 mb-20"><strong>1=
. App Testing: Agent tests the apps it builds (using an actual browser)</st=
rong></h3><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24"><strong>=
Agent 3 now tests and fixes the app it is building</strong>, constantly imp=
roving your app behind the scenes. We are launching two different options h=
ere, depending on your needs:</p><ul class=3D"list-disc"><li><strong>App Te=
sting</strong> is on by default, but can be turned off within the <em class=
=3D"italic">Agent Tools</em> section of the input box within the workspace.=
</li><li><strong>Max Autonomy (Beta)</strong> lets Agent run for longer and=
 manage itself=E2=80=94ideal for complex, extended tasks with well-defined =
goals.</li></ul><figure class=3D"flex flex-col items-center my-16"><div cla=
ss=3D"max-w-[800px] w-full"><img src=3D"https://cdn.replit.com/sanity/blog/=
Screenshot%202025-09-10%20at%207.13.02%C3%A2%C2%80%C2%AFAM.png" alt=3D"App =
Testing" class=3D"w-full rounded-8 border border-outlineDimmest mb-0 !my-0"=
></div></figure><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24"><s=
trong>When <em class=3D"italic">App Testing</em> is on, the Agent will peri=
odically decide to test your application. </strong>You=E2=80=99ll be able t=
o see a browser preview within the Agent pane, showing the Agent=E2=80=99s =
cursor as it clicks around the app. It checks buttons, forms, APIs, data so=
urces etc =E2=80=94 ensuring every part of your app works perfectly. The Ag=
ent will reply back with a summary of its tests, and fix any issues that it=
 detected. Agent can even automatically log into applications built with <a=
 href=3D"https://blog.replit.com/auth">Replit Auth</a> to test the user log=
in flow.</p><figure class=3D"flex flex-col items-center my-16"><div class=
=3D"max-w-[800px] w-full"><img src=3D"https://cdn.replit.com/sanity/blog/ap=
p%20testing.png" alt=3D"App Testing" class=3D"w-full rounded-8 border borde=
r-outlineDimmest mb-0 !my-0"></div></figure><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-=
accentBrandLighter mb-24">Note: the Agent will not test the App created aft=
er 100% of user messages, instead it will decide to test the App when it th=
inks enough has changed to deem it necessary.<br><br>With <strong>Max auton=
omy</strong>, Agent can run for extended periods of time (200 minutes or mo=
re) with minimal supervision, exhibiting the following behaviors:</p><ul cl=
ass=3D"list-disc"><li><strong>Extended sessions</strong>: Agent runs longer=
 without requiring user input.</li><li><strong>Task management</strong>: Ag=
ent able to create and work through longer task lists.</li><li><strong>Self=
-supervision</strong>: Agent monitors its own progress during the session.<=
/li></ul><h3 id=3D"2.-agent-can-now-build-other-agents-and-automations" cla=
ss=3D"text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight mt-40 mb-20"><strong>2. Agent ca=
n now build other Agents &amp; Automations</strong></h3><p class=3D"hover:p=
rose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24"></p><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-ac=
centBrandLighter mb-24"><strong>For the first time ever, Agent 3 can build =
other agents and automations.</strong> That means you can automate complex =
and repetitive workflows using natural language. Just select the =E2=80=9CA=
gents &amp; Automations=E2=80=9D option from the homepage to get started.</=
p><figure class=3D"flex flex-col items-center my-16"><div class=3D"max-w-[8=
00px] w-full"><img src=3D"https://cdn.replit.com/sanity/blog/blog-agents.pn=
g" alt=3D"Agents &amp; Automations" class=3D"w-full rounded-8 border border=
-outlineDimmest mb-0 !my-0"></div></figure><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-a=
ccentBrandLighter mb-24"></p><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLigh=
ter mb-24">With this option, you can build things like Telegram bots, Slack=
 agents, and time-based automations (e.g. daily reminders). Just like build=
ing normal apps, you=E2=80=99ll describe what you want in words. However, u=
nlike most Replit apps there=E2=80=99s no preview =E2=80=94 you=E2=80=99ll =
deploy Agents &amp; Automations to use them in another surface via an integ=
ration (e.g. in Telegram, Slack or Email).</p><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:tex=
t-accentBrandLighter mb-24">When building an Agent or Automation, on one si=
de of the workspace you=E2=80=99ll see the Agent pane, just like other type=
s of Replit apps. On the other side, instead of a preview you=E2=80=99ll se=
e an admin dashboard where you can test your chatbot or workflow automation=
.</p><figure class=3D"flex flex-col items-center my-16"><div class=3D"max-w=
-[800px] w-full"><img src=3D"https://cdn.replit.com/sanity/blog/automation.=
png" alt=3D"Automations" class=3D"w-full rounded-8 border border-outlineDim=
mest mb-0 !my-0"></div></figure><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandL=
ighter mb-24"><strong>You can also build automations with apps like Notion,=
 Linear, Dropbox, Sharepoint etc</strong>. For example, when you ask an Age=
nt to build something that involves Notion, it now guides you through a sea=
mless connection flow. Instead of manually hunting down and pasting API key=
s, the Agent surfaces a simple UI flow to connect with Notion. Once finishe=
d, the Agent securely receives the credentials it needs and continues build=
ing automatically.</p><figure class=3D"flex flex-col items-center my-16"><d=
iv class=3D"max-w-[800px] w-full"><img src=3D"https://cdn.replit.com/sanity=
/blog/connectors.png" alt=3D"Connectors" class=3D"w-full rounded-8 border b=
order-outlineDimmest mb-0 !my-0"></div></figure><h3 id=3D"automations-made-=
possible" class=3D"text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight mt-40 mb-20"><stron=
g>Automations made possible</strong></h3><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-acc=
entBrandLighter mb-24"></p><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighte=
r mb-24">With Agent 3=E2=80=99s ability to build Agents and Automations, a =
whole new range of possibilities opens up. For example, you can create auto=
mations like:</p><ul class=3D"list-disc"><li><strong>Slack bot</strong> tha=
t answers questions about your codebase by integrating with GitHub.</li><li=
><strong>Slack bot</strong> that retrieves and queries information from you=
r Notion database.</li><li><strong>Automated daily email</strong> summarizi=
ng your tasks from Linear.</li><li><strong>Automated meeting prep email</st=
rong>: sent 20 minutes before each external meeting, it searches the web fo=
r details about your guest and their company, summarizes key points with AI=
, and saves the notes to Google Drive.</li><li><strong>Telegram bot</strong=
> that can schedule appointments directly on your Outlook Calendar.</li></u=
l><h3 id=3D"3.-longer-autonomous-runtime" class=3D"text-2xl font-semibold l=
eading-tight mt-40 mb-20"><strong>3. Longer Autonomous Runtime</strong></h3=
><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24"></p><figure class=
=3D"flex flex-col items-center my-16"><div class=3D"max-w-[800px] w-full"><=
