Autonomous Run" class=3D"w-full rounded-8 border border-outlineDimmest mb-0=
 !my-0"></div></figure><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb=
-24"></p><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24"><strong>A=
gent 3 runs on its own for up to 200 minutes</strong>, <strong>handling ful=
l tasks autonomously=E2=80=94building, testing and fixing your app,</strong=
> with minimal manual oversight, giving you hours of time back. You can tra=
ck your project=E2=80=99s progress, in real time, on your home page on the =
web or live monitoring on your phone.</p><h3 id=3D"4.-new-app-creation-flow=
" class=3D"text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight mt-40 mb-20"><strong>4. New=
 App Creation Flow</strong></h3><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandL=
ighter mb-24">While Agent is now more powerful, we know you don=E2=80=99t a=
lways need full-stack capabilities=E2=80=94sometimes you just want to proto=
type quickly or iterate on designs before deciding to build a full app. Tha=
t=E2=80=99s why we=E2=80=99re launching a new app creation flow that gives =
you flexibility: either build a full-stack app right away, or start with fr=
ontend-only for rapid prototyping and design iteration and add a backend la=
ter if you=E2=80=99d like.</p><figure class=3D"flex flex-col items-center m=
y-16"><div class=3D"max-w-[800px] w-full"><img src=3D"https://cdn.replit.co=
m/sanity/blog/new%20creation%20flow.png" alt=3D"New creation flow" class=3D=
"w-full rounded-8 border border-outlineDimmest mb-0 !my-0"></div></figure><=
p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24">You can select the =
right mode to ensure Agent always works in the mode that best fits your goa=
ls.</p><h3 id=3D"autonomy-for-all" class=3D"text-2xl font-semibold leading-=
tight mt-40 mb-20"><strong>Autonomy for All</strong></h3><p class=3D"hover:=
prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24">This is just the beginning=E2=80=94A=
gent will keep getting more powerful as we climb the autonomy curve, with m=
ore integrations, trigger-based automations, and other updates to make buil=
ding anything on Replit easier than ever.</p><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text=
-accentBrandLighter mb-24">Agent 3 is available for all free and paid users=
